decide-below: the chain hid less than the gate's last wave: take one nsys window of a decode step (the gate's
  and the chain's start and end) before any other fork; under +2 %, the chain waited for the gate's whole
  grid, and the next arm runs the branch at a higher stream priority with node priority on the graph's
  instantiate
decide-above: the small-launch chain is longer than 83 us a layer, the card serial's gap of decomp §1: land,
